WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.267
-The committee investigating the
January 6th insurrection

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:06.467
has subpoenaed another round of
Trump allies,

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:08.167
as multiple
investigations of Trump

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.200
and his inner circle intensify
and Republicans

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.901
continue their attempt to take
control of our elections.

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:15.067
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:19.300
♪♪

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.934
Guys, tomorrow is a big day.

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:23.701
No, it's not just Thanksgiving,
it's the deadline

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:27.567
MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell
set for himself to file

00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:30.234
his supposedly blockbuster
Supreme Court case,

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:34.334
proving definitively that there
was fraud in the 2020 election.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.601
-I cannot wait to drop this
Supreme Court case

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:40.234
the Tuesday at 9:00 a.m.
before Thanksgiving,

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:44.033
and the whole world is going
to be watching all this unfold

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:45.467
over Thanksgiving.

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:49.868
-You are saying that on the
Tuesday before Thanksgiving,

00:00:49.868 --> 00:00:51.767
which I think
is four weeks away,

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.234
you're going to drop a lawsuit.

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:56.334
So you can go back and have
fistfights?

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:59.434
The family squabbles.
Lindell, your genius.

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:00.701
Only you could've thought of
this.

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:01.934
-Steve, Steve,
I wanna say this --

00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:03.467
-The country's going to
go back at --

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:05.701
your holidays
are ruined again, okay?

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:08.968
-And when I say before
Thanksgiving, we are bringing

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.200
the case to them down before
Thanksgiving, everybody.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.167
Getting
all these states on board,

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:16.334
we've got right now
upwards of nine.

00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:20.601
I want to get at least
25 on board.

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:24.067
-"Upwards of nine" already
sounds like a problematically

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:26.567
vague wording
for a Supreme Court case.

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:28.667
"And how many states are on
board, Mr. Lindell?"

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:32.100
"Upwards of nine."
"So 10."

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:36.400
"There's about 10 for sure,
that ballpark, yeah."

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.000
"Why won't you tell us the
exact number?"

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.434
"It's not important, just please
make my friend president again."

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:44.400
And, I'm sorry,
Steve Bannon thinks Americans

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:45.868
need a lawsuit
from Mike Lindell

00:01:45.868 --> 00:01:47.567
to have a reason
to fight at Thanksgiving.

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:52.767
My Uncle Ron needs to drinks
and he turns into Mike Lindell.

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:55.267
One minute, he's telling
Aunt Debbie she's his light,

00:01:55.267 --> 00:01:56.734
and the next minute
he's screaming,

00:01:56.734 --> 00:02:01.734
"You pretend to be a loyal wife,
but I know about the affairs!"

00:02:04.601 --> 00:02:07.534
And again, I know Lindell's
from Minnesota and not Chicago,

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:10.901
but I don't care.

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:13.400
Still, good news for families
trying to avoid conflict.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.901
Lindell has failed to file
his lawsuit, as promised,

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.300
and he's blaming it on the
Republican National Committee.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:21.534
Lindell accused the RNC of
calling state attorneys general

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:24.167
and pressuring them
not to sign the complaint.

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:26.701
He also said he was flying
to five different states

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:28.934
to get attorneys general
to sign the document.

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:30.801
Holiday travel is
stressful enough as it is.

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:32.734
Imagine being in a boarding area
with this guy

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:35.601
who is definitely going to
stand up when Group One

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:38.834
is called, no matter
what group he's sitting in.

00:02:38.834 --> 00:02:40.968
Plus, you know, he carries
his ticket in some weird

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:43.601
Ziploc travel pouch.
He forgot how to open.

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:48.901
It's tricky because you got to
pull it while you squeeze it.

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:51.167
There are two things happening
on parallel tracks

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:52.367
right now,
in American politics.

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:53.934
On the one hand,
Republicans like Lindell

00:02:53.934 --> 00:02:56.801
are still spreading the big lie
that the election was stolen,

00:02:56.801 --> 00:02:59.367
making it easier
to overturn future results

00:02:59.367 --> 00:03:00.968
they don't like.
And on the other hand,

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:03.734
several major investigations
of key Trump allies

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:05.367
who tried to steal
the last election

00:03:05.367 --> 00:03:06.801
are getting more serious.

00:03:06.801 --> 00:03:08.901
For example, the congressional
committee investigating

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:10.634
the January 6th insurrection
has subpoenaed

00:03:10.634 --> 00:03:11.934
five more Trump allies,

00:03:11.934 --> 00:03:14.367
including disgraced
right wing conspiracy theorist

00:03:14.367 --> 00:03:16.968
Alex Jones, who always looks
like he's trying to hulk out,

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:19.033
even though he wasn't
exposed to gamma rays.

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:20.534
And Roger Stone,

00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:22.801
the guy who famously showed
up to Trump's inauguration

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:24.801
looking like an 18th century
oil baron

00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:26.567
who makes his own meth
at home.

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:28.467
Quick aside,
we've use that photo

00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:30.167
so many times over the years,
I honestly

00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:31.934
can't remember
which jokes we made about it

00:03:31.934 --> 00:03:34.167
and which ones we haven't.
Here's a bunch anyway.

00:03:34.167 --> 00:03:36.234
This guy looks like
Willy Wonka's mortician.

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:39.734
Is Quentin Tarantino
remaking "Lincoln"?

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:41.934
He looks like a fella
who just made his first million

00:03:41.934 --> 00:03:44.067
in the Zeppelin business.

00:03:44.067 --> 00:03:46.300
Dude looks like he's trying
to sneak into the Met Gala

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.400
to sell cocaine.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.667
"Hey, Chalamet!

00:03:55.834 --> 00:03:58.133
Chalamet.

00:03:58.133 --> 00:04:01.400
Care to partake
in the Devil's dandruff?"

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:06.334
Now, you might remember that
Stone was already convicted

00:04:06.334 --> 00:04:07.968
as part of
the Russia investigation,

00:04:07.968 --> 00:04:09.501
but his sentence
was commuted by Trump,

00:04:09.501 --> 00:04:11.434
and he ended up right back
in the middle of Trump's

00:04:11.434 --> 00:04:14.067
inner circle,
helping hatch their next scheme.

00:04:14.067 --> 00:04:17.067
-Stone was convicted
of seven felony counts

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:18.734
stemming from the Russia
investigation,

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:21.067
including obstruction
of the investigation,

00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:25.100
lying to investigators
and witness tampering.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:28.234
That then only resulted
in President Trump

00:04:28.234 --> 00:04:30.834
commuting his sentence
in July 2020,

00:04:30.834 --> 00:04:32.534
just in time for Stone
to help plan

00:04:32.534 --> 00:04:34.901
the January 6th insurrection.

00:04:34.901 --> 00:04:37.567
Stone appeared at multiple
Stop the Steal events

00:04:37.567 --> 00:04:38.934
in the days
leading up to the attack.

00:04:38.934 --> 00:04:41.734
-Stone is part of this
constellation

00:04:41.734 --> 00:04:44.567
of far right
media personalities,

00:04:44.567 --> 00:04:48.133
perhaps more than anybody else.
Roger Stone is fluent in Trump,

00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:51.367
and he knows how to produce
slogans and commentary

00:04:51.367 --> 00:04:53.067
that fit into his vernacular.

00:04:53.067 --> 00:04:55.033
-What does it mean
to be "fluent in Trump"?

00:04:55.033 --> 00:04:57.234
You only use words
with one syllable.

00:04:57.234 --> 00:04:59.367
You talk like a cab driver
from Queens,

00:04:59.367 --> 00:05:01.567
or you know how to stretch
a single sentence

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:03.234
into a rambling,
hour long monologue.

00:05:03.234 --> 00:05:04.901
Can you imagine
one of those

00:05:04.901 --> 00:05:06.234
French-to-English
travel dictionaries?

00:05:06.234 --> 00:05:07.567
Except it was Trump-to-English?

00:05:07.567 --> 00:05:09.968
Alright, let me translate.

00:05:09.968 --> 00:05:12.634
So, Trump said, "A man came out
to me, tears in his eyes."

00:05:12.634 --> 00:05:14.501
He said, 'Sir, you're bringing
America back, sir.

00:05:14.501 --> 00:05:16.234
We're living in the golden age
of America, sir.

00:05:16.234 --> 00:05:18.000
They're just like
the golden age of television.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.934
Lucille Ball. 'I love Lucy.'
You love Lucy. We all love Lucy.

00:05:20.934 --> 00:05:22.167
Don't we folks?

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:23.801
She ate all that chocolate
and got paid for it.

00:05:23.801 --> 00:05:25.434
What a deal.
I said to my team.

00:05:25.434 --> 00:05:27.634
'We need more chocolate eating
jobs,' and that's what we did.

00:05:27.634 --> 00:05:29.033
We opened more
chocolate factories

00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:31.434
under my administration
than any previous administration

00:05:31.434 --> 00:05:33.033
in history.
Witch Hunt."

00:05:33.033 --> 00:05:38.701
Okay. And that translates
to "I am sad inside."

00:05:38.701 --> 00:05:41.434
So investigators are closing in
on more Trump allies,

00:05:41.434 --> 00:05:43.467
the investigation
has already subpoenaed

00:05:43.467 --> 00:05:45.834
former New York Police
Commissioner Bernard Kerik,

00:05:45.834 --> 00:05:47.400
a close ally
of Rudy Giuliani,

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.767
who is part of a so-called
command center

00:05:49.767 --> 00:05:52.834
set up by Trump cronies like
Steve Bannon ahead of the Jan.

00:05:52.834 --> 00:05:54.834
six insurrection,
where they hatched plans

00:05:54.834 --> 00:05:56.367
to steal the election
from Biden.

00:05:56.367 --> 00:05:59.901
-The headquarters for some
key figures in Trump's effort

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:04.200
to overturn the 2020 election.
Rudy Giuliani, Steve Bannon,

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:08.167
former New York City Police
Commissioner Bernard Kerik

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:10.367
and conservative lawyer
John Eastman

00:06:10.367 --> 00:06:12.801
holed up
in Washington's Willard Hotel.

00:06:12.801 --> 00:06:15.100
Walking distance
from the White House

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.033
in a suite of rooms they called
"The Command Center."

00:06:18.033 --> 00:06:20.200
-It's just fun to imagine
Rudy Giuliani

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.367
running a command center
in a hotel room.

00:06:22.367 --> 00:06:23.501
"Let's get started.

00:06:23.501 --> 00:06:25.400
Bernie, you split up
the free toiletries,

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.033
I call the tiny shampoo.

00:06:27.033 --> 00:06:30.601
Steve, ordered me a Cobb salad,
but six rows of eggs.

00:06:30.601 --> 00:06:34.667
They know how to do it."
It's also important to remember

00:06:34.667 --> 00:06:37.601
these people only hang out
with each other

00:06:37.601 --> 00:06:41.267
because there is no one else
who will hang out with them.

00:06:41.267 --> 00:06:43.200
If Bernie Kerik
had other options,

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.634
do you think he would still roll
with Rudy Giuliani,

00:06:45.634 --> 00:06:47.634
who publicly implied
a few months ago

00:06:47.634 --> 00:06:49.334
that they all partied
with disgraced

00:06:49.334 --> 00:06:50.634
royal Prince Andrew.

00:06:50.634 --> 00:06:53.901
-I told this to the Queen of
England. She said

00:06:53.901 --> 00:06:57.634
[As Queen Elizabeth] "You did,
you did a wonderful job

00:06:57.634 --> 00:07:00.100
on September 11,

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.634
And therefore I'm making you
an honorary knight

00:07:02.634 --> 00:07:07.701
commander of the royal,
something or other.

00:07:07.701 --> 00:07:09.367
[ Normal voice ]
I turned down a knighthood

00:07:09.367 --> 00:07:10.534
because if you took
a knighthood,

00:07:10.534 --> 00:07:12.667
you had to lose
your citizenship.

00:07:12.667 --> 00:07:15.701
I know Prince Andrew
is very questionable now.

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:17.167
I never went out with him.

00:07:17.167 --> 00:07:21.133
Never, never,
never had a drink with him.

00:07:21.133 --> 00:07:25.267
Never was with a woman or a
young girl with him ever, ever.

00:07:25.267 --> 00:07:27.601
One time I met him
in my office,

00:07:27.601 --> 00:07:29.901
and one time when we had the
party right party, right Bernie,

00:07:29.901 --> 00:07:32.968
you were there.

00:07:32.968 --> 00:07:36.534
You weren't there? Oh [bleep]

00:07:36.534 --> 00:07:38.434
"You weren't there?
Oh, now I remember, Bernie.

00:07:38.434 --> 00:07:42.767
You said if anyone ever asked,
I wasn't here.

00:07:42.767 --> 00:07:45.968
And then you said,
wink wink."

00:07:45.968 --> 00:07:47.968
Oh, just say what you will
about my impressions,

00:07:47.968 --> 00:07:49.467
but they're way better
than Rudy's.

00:07:49.467 --> 00:07:52.734
I mean, is that is that what he
thinks the queen sounds like?

00:07:52.734 --> 00:07:56.601
Who does he think played her in
"The Crown," Al Pacino?

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:59.367
[ As Pacino ] "Whoa, nothing
makes me smile like a Corgi

00:07:59.367 --> 00:08:02.767
running across
a well-manicured lawn.

00:08:02.767 --> 00:08:06.834
Low to the ground
and fast like a rocket ship.

00:08:06.834 --> 00:08:09.434
Let's get a round of crumpets.

00:08:09.434 --> 00:08:12.067
Out here.

00:08:13.267 --> 00:08:16.701
It is always crumpet o'clock.

00:08:16.701 --> 00:08:18.300
At Buckingham Palace.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.534
And of course,
Rudy is already facing

00:08:24.534 --> 00:08:25.868
his own criminal investigation

00:08:25.868 --> 00:08:28.033
for trying to cheat
in the 2020 election

00:08:28.033 --> 00:08:30.167
before the results came in.

00:08:30.167 --> 00:08:32.934
Investigators are focusing
on his attempts to dig up dirt

00:08:32.934 --> 00:08:34.234
on Joe Biden in Ukraine.

00:08:34.234 --> 00:08:36.234
And as you might recall,
his home and office

00:08:36.234 --> 00:08:38.133
were raided by the feds
earlier this year.

00:08:38.133 --> 00:08:39.934
Last night, he was on Newsmax
and claimed

00:08:39.934 --> 00:08:42.734
that only Trump cronies
are targeted by the feds.

00:08:42.734 --> 00:08:45.601
-[ British accent ]
I have to get your reaction
to the breaking news.

00:08:45.601 --> 00:08:50.133
These five new subpoenas
from the January 6th

00:08:50.133 --> 00:08:52.100
committee of Nancy Pelosi.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:55.634
The idea that we've had
Roger Stone subpoenaed

00:08:55.634 --> 00:08:58.567
Alex Jones,
three other individuals

00:08:58.567 --> 00:09:01.767
add to that Mark Meadows
and Steve Bannon.

00:09:01.767 --> 00:09:05.267
Are we seeing the collapse
of of the rule of law

00:09:05.267 --> 00:09:09.434
at the highest levels
in the United States, Mr. Mayor?

00:09:09.434 --> 00:09:10.734
-Yeah, Sebastian, we watched

00:09:10.734 --> 00:09:12.334
that all through
the Trump presidency.

00:09:12.334 --> 00:09:16.968
I mean, the Democrats handled
themselves like fascists.

00:09:16.968 --> 00:09:19.567
They -- there were
no constitutional rules.

00:09:19.567 --> 00:09:22.834
Why is it that the only lawyers
whose law offices

00:09:22.834 --> 00:09:25.901
get broken into
are Donald Trump's lawyers?

00:09:25.901 --> 00:09:28.868
Remember, they went and got
my iCloud account.

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:32.467
I'm a lawyer.
-Alright, but not really.

00:09:32.467 --> 00:09:35.334
I mean, your law license
was suspended

00:09:35.334 --> 00:09:37.434
and you lost every case
you brought after the election.

00:09:37.434 --> 00:09:38.868
The only thing
you succeeded at doing

00:09:38.868 --> 00:09:41.133
was drumming up publicity
for a landscaping company.

00:09:41.133 --> 00:09:44.367
I mean, it looks like
he's shooting

00:09:44.367 --> 00:09:45.868
a local commercial for them,
[As Giuliani]

00:09:45.868 --> 00:09:48.033
Come on down to Four Seasons
Total Landscaping,

00:09:48.033 --> 00:09:51.834
our prices are so crazy you'll
be screaming, "Why God?"

00:09:54.434 --> 00:09:56.701
"Why?"

00:09:56.701 --> 00:09:58.133
[ Normal voice ] But hey, at
least he's not the kind of guy

00:09:58.133 --> 00:10:02.501
who puts his thumb
on the front-facing camera.

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:03.801
More importantly,
let's go back to this

00:10:03.801 --> 00:10:05.200
penetrating question.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:09.267
-Why is it that the only lawyers
law offices get broken into

00:10:09.267 --> 00:10:10.868
are Donald Trump's lawyers?

00:10:10.868 --> 00:10:13.267
-Yeah, why is it such a mystery?

00:10:13.267 --> 00:10:14.934
It's like asking
why the only rats

00:10:14.934 --> 00:10:17.467
who go viral are pizza rats.

00:10:17.467 --> 00:10:19.734
What about all the other
everyday working class rats?

00:10:19.734 --> 00:10:23.634
When is their time in the sun?

00:10:23.634 --> 00:10:25.234
The Command Center,
the lawsuits,

00:10:25.234 --> 00:10:26.334
the Ukrainian scheme?

00:10:26.334 --> 00:10:27.734
All of it was part
of the Trump team's

00:10:27.734 --> 00:10:29.801
attempt to cheat in
or steal the election.

00:10:29.801 --> 00:10:32.868
And as part of that effort,
they produced memo after memo

00:10:32.868 --> 00:10:35.133
laying out a detailed plan
for Vice President Mike Pence

00:10:35.133 --> 00:10:36.801
to reject
the Electoral College count.

00:10:36.801 --> 00:10:39.334
There were a bunch of memos
from several Trump lackeys.

00:10:39.334 --> 00:10:41.467
In fact, former Trump national
security adviser Michael Flynn

00:10:41.467 --> 00:10:42.901
even tried to get
the Pentagon involved

00:10:42.901 --> 00:10:44.367
in their attempted coup.

00:10:44.367 --> 00:10:46.701
It wasn't just an impulse,
or Trump randomly lashing out,

00:10:46.701 --> 00:10:48.067
they had a detailed plan.

00:10:48.067 --> 00:10:49.701
and a Command Center
to pull it off.

00:10:49.701 --> 00:10:52.501
And believe me,
I'm as shocked as you are

00:10:52.501 --> 00:10:55.501
that these misshapen
potato chips had a plan.

00:10:55.501 --> 00:10:56.701
It's much easier
to think of them

00:10:56.701 --> 00:10:58.601
as a bunch of easily
distracted doofuses

00:10:58.601 --> 00:11:00.501
who get caught trying to steal
a pen from a bank

00:11:00.501 --> 00:11:03.200
without realizing
it's chained to the desk.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.300
But they did have a plan

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.767
and they came close
to pulling it off,

00:11:05.767 --> 00:11:07.133
which means they're almost
certainly going to try it again.

00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:08.367
Except this time
they're trying to do it

00:11:08.367 --> 00:11:10.100
by changing the laws
to make it easier,

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.634
and they have
Republican officials in states

00:11:11.634 --> 00:11:13.868
across the country helping them.
They've already started

00:11:13.868 --> 00:11:16.133
passing new voting laws
in at least 17 states,

00:11:16.133 --> 00:11:18.634
and now they've landed on their
next target, Wisconsin.

00:11:18.634 --> 00:11:21.868
-In a stunning new piece of
reporting in The New York Times,

00:11:21.868 --> 00:11:24.601
Ron Johnson and other
Republicans in Wisconsin

00:11:24.601 --> 00:11:26.834
have now launched
an all out assault

00:11:26.834 --> 00:11:28.901
on their state's
election system

00:11:28.901 --> 00:11:32.167
to ensure Republicans have full
control over its voting process.

00:11:32.167 --> 00:11:35.067
From that reporting
"the Republican effort broader

00:11:35.067 --> 00:11:38.033
and more forceful
than that in any other state,

00:11:38.033 --> 00:11:40.200
where allies of former
President Donald J. Trump

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:42.200
are trying to overhaul
elections,

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.634
takes direct aim
at the bipartisan Wisconsin

00:11:44.634 --> 00:11:46.100
Elections Commission."

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.133
Last month, a report ordered
by Republican state legislators

00:11:49.133 --> 00:11:51.434
and performed
by Wisconsin's nonpartisan

00:11:51.434 --> 00:11:55.701
Legislative Audit Bureau,
found, big surprise here

00:11:55.701 --> 00:11:58.767
no widespread fraud
in the 2020 election.

00:11:58.767 --> 00:12:01.234
But the report did make
dozens of recommendations

00:12:01.234 --> 00:12:04.534
for the Election Commission,
and Republicans pounced.

00:12:04.534 --> 00:12:06.667
-Think about how insane that is.
They conducted an audit

00:12:06.667 --> 00:12:08.000
that found
no evidence of fraud

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.534
but made a bunch
of recommendations anyway.

00:12:09.534 --> 00:12:10.634
It's like if you went
to the doctor

00:12:10.634 --> 00:12:11.901
for a physical
and he said,

00:12:11.901 --> 00:12:13.267
"Alright, everything
looks perfect.

00:12:13.267 --> 00:12:16.267
We'll take the leg off
on Monday.

00:12:16.267 --> 00:12:17.601
Not sure how many bones
are in there,

00:12:17.601 --> 00:12:19.834
but it's got to be -"
-Upwards of nine.

00:12:19.834 --> 00:12:22.601
[ Laughter ]

00:12:22.601 --> 00:12:25.133
-Dah, callback!

00:12:25.133 --> 00:12:27.300
This is the single
greatest existential threat

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.701
to our democracy right now,

00:12:28.701 --> 00:12:30.601
and it's hanging over
every aspect of our politics,

00:12:30.601 --> 00:12:32.033
one party wants
to take control

00:12:32.033 --> 00:12:33.334
so they can never
lose power again.

00:12:33.334 --> 00:12:35.701
From Steve Bannon to
Roger Stone to Rudy Giuliani,

00:12:35.701 --> 00:12:37.067
it seems like everyone
around Trump

00:12:37.067 --> 00:12:39.133
was involved
in the attempted coup.

00:12:39.133 --> 00:12:40.901
And now that they're
all getting subpoenaed,

00:12:40.901 --> 00:12:42.400
